Subject: [R-pkg-team] Bug#969900: ITP: r-cran-waldo -- find differences
 between R objects
Message-ID: <159957291298.305718.10453941549382182622.reportbug@sputnik.fam-tille.de>

Package: wnpp
Severity: wishlist

Subject: ITP: r-cran-waldo -- find differences between R objects
Package: wnpp
Owner: Andreas Tille <tille at debian.org>
Severity: wishlist

* Package name    : r-cran-waldo
  Version         : 0.2.0
  Upstream Author : Hadley Wickham,
* URL             : https://cran.r-project.org/package=waldo
* License         : MIT
  Programming Lang: GNU R
  Description     : find differences between R objects
 Compare complex R objects and reveal the key
 differences.  Designed particularly for use in testing packages where
