Subject: [R-pkg-team] Bug#970710: ITP: r-cran-wkutils -- GNU R utilities for
 well-known geometry vectors
Message-ID: <160076184243.3404335.7457505868309006899.reportbug@sputnik.fam-tille.de>

Package: wnpp
